      "cluster_id": 0,
      "headline_hint": "US envoys Kushner and Witkoff visit Kyiv for peace talks following Moscow meetings",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 0,
      "claim_count": 16,
      "distinct_outlets": 4,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 16
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner visited Kyiv for the first time since Russia's full-scale invasion of Ukraine.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner travelled to Kyiv by train due to the risk of Russian drone strikes.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky greeted Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner at Kyiv's Saint Sophia Cathedral.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russian drones hit the headquarters of Ukraine's security services near Saint Sophia Cathedral on Friday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "UK National Security Adviser Jonathan Powell and other European national security advisers joined the talks in Kyiv.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Vladimir Putin told US envoys in Moscow that Russia was making 'tangible advances' on the battlefield.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian officials claim that in August Russia suffered 42,000 dead or wounded casualties and Ukraine gained more territory than it lost.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russia and Ukraine agreed to a short-term pause in air strikes during the US envoys' visit to Kyiv.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c980j5m8mpro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russian strikes bombed Kyiv's two main airports on Friday, forcing Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff to travel by train.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-envoys-jared-kushner-steve-witkoff-arrive-kyiv-talks-on-ending-war",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russia and Ukraine pledged to refrain from attacking each other's capitals over the weekend to ensure safe passage for the US envoys.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-envoys-jared-kushner-steve-witkoff-arrive-kyiv-talks-on-ending-war",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Volodymyr Zelenskyy stated that Ukraine is counting on a winter package from the US and Europe including air defence, energy support, and American LNG.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-envoys-jared-kushner-steve-witkoff-arrive-kyiv-talks-on-ending-war",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian authorities reported on Sunday that at least eight people were killed and 69 injured across Ukraine in the past day.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-envoys-jared-kushner-steve-witkoff-arrive-kyiv-talks-on-ending-war",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Peace talks between Russia and Ukraine have focused on a 20-point peace plan put forward by Washington and Kyiv in December.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-envoys-jared-kushner-steve-witkoff-arrive-kyiv-talks-on-ending-war",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoy Steve Witkoff stated that peace talks in Ukraine have been 'very meaningful'.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/9/6/witkoff-says-peace-talks-have-been-very-meaningful-in-ukraine?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff held three hours of talks with Russian President Vladimir Putin in Moscow on Saturday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/us-envoys-make-first-kyiv-visit-amid-ukraine-war-peace-push-6365591",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukraine reported striking the Ryazan oil refinery about 480 km inside Russia overnight, causing a fire.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/us-envoys-make-first-kyiv-visit-amid-ukraine-war-peace-push-6365591",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "headline_hint": "Amazon Air cargo plane crashes at Miami International Airport, killing at least five",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 1,
      "claim_count": 11,
      "distinct_outlets": 4,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 11
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 17,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "At least five people were killed and five injured after an Amazon cargo plane overshot the runway at Miami International Airport on Sunday and crashed into several vehicles.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260906-amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport-killing-at-least-five",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Miami Sheriff Rosie Cordero-Stutz stated there was 'no apparent threat to public safety' following the crash.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20260906-amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport-killing-at-least-five",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "An Amazon cargo plane arriving from San Juan, Puerto Rico, overshot the runway at Miami International Airport on Sunday afternoon and struck several vehicles.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Miami-Dade County Mayor Daniella Levine Cava stated that five people were killed and five others were injured in the crash.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The FAA confirmed 21 Air Flight 7598, a Boeing 767-300 cargo aircraft, overran the runway at Miami International Airport around 2 pm local time on Sunday, September 6.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "All runways and taxiways at Miami International Airport were closed as of 3 pm following the cargo plane crash.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "More than 60 units from Miami-Dade Fire Rescue responded to the scene of the plane crash.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Miami-Dade Sheriff's Office closed NW 67th Avenue between NW 25th Street and NW 36th Street following the crash.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/06/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-miami-airport",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy stated that the agency issued a full ground stop in Miami after the crash.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/6/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-in-us-while-landing-at-miami-airport?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The Boeing 767-300 cargo plane involved in the crash was over 32 years old, having first flown in June 1994 as a passenger aircraft.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-at-miami-airport-after-overshooting-runway-fire-erupts-11788727190248.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Cargo carrier 21 Air began operating Boeing 767-300 freighters for Amazon in 2024.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/amazon-cargo-plane-crashes-at-miami-airport-after-overshooting-runway-fire-erupts-11788727190248.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 2,
      "headline_hint": "Far-right AfD wins state election in Saxony-Anhalt, Germany",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 2,
      "claim_count": 10,
      "distinct_outlets": 3,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 10
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 28,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Incomplete results show Alternative for Germany (AfD) set to win a record 44% of the vote in the Saxony-Anhalt state election.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy4zejgz3z9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "AfD state leader Ulrich Siegmund described the election result in Saxony-Anhalt as 'sensational'.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy4zejgz3z9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Saxony-Anhalt has a population of 2.1 million and its branch of the AfD is classified by domestic intelligence as 'right-wing extremist'.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy4zejgz3z9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Voter turnout in the Saxony-Anhalt state election was estimated at 78%.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy4zejgz3z9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The conservative CDU finished second in the Saxony-Anhalt election with just over 17% of the vote.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy4zejgz3z9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Exit polls showed Die Linke won 9.3%, the Social Democrats won 8.4%, and the Greens won 8.7% in the Saxony-Anhalt state election.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/saxony-anhalt-germany-afd-exit-poll-ulrich-siegmund",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The BSW party reached the 5% threshold required to enter the state parliament in Saxony-Anhalt.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/saxony-anhalt-germany-afd-exit-poll-ulrich-siegmund",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "AfD candidate Ulrich Siegmund promised to launch a remigration and deportation offensive, ban rainbow flags in schools, and halt new windfarm construction if AfD forms a government.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/saxony-anhalt-germany-afd-exit-poll-ulrich-siegmund",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Modern Germany has never had a far-right or right-wing populist party lead a national government, state government, or major-city administration since World War II.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/afd-projected-to-score-historic-victory-in-german-state-election-but-path-to-power-remains-unclear-11788716551220.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "CDU national general secretary Franziska Hoppermann described the election result as 'very difficult' for her party while rejecting cooperation with the AfD.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/afd-projected-to-score-historic-victory-in-german-state-election-but-path-to-power-remains-unclear-11788716551220.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
