          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Indonesian authorities temporarily suspended operations at eight airports due to volcanic ash from Anak Krakatau, leaving around 170,000 passengers stranded.",
          "kind": "figure",
