          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgy5k4n07ko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "The Indonesian transport ministry reported that 1,558 flights were delayed due to airport closures.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgy5k4n07ko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Volcanic ash from Anak Krakatau reached up to 20,000 feet on the Java side and 50,000 feet on the Sumatra side.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgy5k4n07ko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Indonesian authorities confirmed there is no tsunami warning associated with the recent activity of Anak Krakatau.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgy5k4n07ko?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Booming sounds from the eruption of Anak Krakatau were heard up to 435 miles (700 km) away.",
